    <div class="ip17-view-switch" role="group" aria-label="选择手机视角"><button type="button" data-view-option="front" aria-label="切换至正面" aria-pressed="false"><span>正</span><small>FRONT</small></button><button class="is-active" type="button" data-view-option="back" aria-label="切换至背面" aria-pressed="true"><span>背</span><small>BACK</small></button></div>
    <div class="ip17-product-colors" role="group" aria-label="选择机身颜色"><button class="orange is-active" type="button" data-color-option="orange" data-tooltip="星宇橙" aria-label="星宇橙" aria-pressed="true"></button><button class="blue" type="button" data-color-option="blue" data-tooltip="深蓝色" aria-label="深蓝色" aria-pressed="false"></button><button class="silver" type="button" data-color-option="silver" data-tooltip="银色" aria-label="银色" aria-pressed="false"></button></div>
    <div class="ip17-product-scroll">向下探索 <b>↓</b></div>
    </div>
  </header>
  <nav class="ip17-product-nav" aria-label="产品章节"><a href="#design">设计</a><a href="#display">显示屏</a><a href="#camera">影像</a><a href="#performance">性能</a><a href="#battery">续航</a></nav>
  <section class="ip17-product-intro" id="design"><p class="ip17-eyebrow">一体成型机身</p><h2>更完整的结构，<br>更强大的 Pro。</h2><p class="ip17-copy">热锻铝金属一体成型机身，将性能、散热与握持感融入同一条连续曲线。横向延展的专业摄像平台，让内部空间得到更高效的利用。</p><figure class="ip17-design-stage ip17-unibody-visual"><img loading="lazy" src="<%- url_for('/images/iphone17-pro/unibody.png') %>" alt="iPhone 17 Pro 一体成型机身结构展示"></figure></section>
  <section class="ip17-stat-band"><div><b>6.9</b><span>英寸<br>超视网膜 XDR 显示屏</span></div><div><b>120</b><span>Hz<br>ProMotion 自适应刷新率</span></div><div><b>3000</b><span>尼特<br>户外峰值亮度</span></div></section>
  <section class="ip17-display-section" id="display"><div class="ip17-display-copy"><p class="ip17-eyebrow">沉浸式 Pro 显示屏</p><h2>大开眼界，<br>也经得起阳光。</h2><p class="ip17-copy">6.9 英寸超视网膜 XDR 显示屏，更高的户外峰值亮度与先进抗反射能力，让画面在强光环境下依然清晰鲜活。</p></div><div class="ip17-screen-stage"><div class="ip17-front-phone"><div class="ip17-island"></div><div class="ip17-screen-art"><i></i><b>17:38</b><span>Thursday, September 18</span></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="ip17-camera-section" id="camera"><header><p class="ip17-eyebrow">Pro Fusion 摄像系统</p><h2>八种焦段，<br>每一种都专业。</h2><p class="ip17-copy">三颗 4800 万像素融合式摄像头，覆盖从微距到 200 mm 长焦的创作视野。无需移动脚步，也能重新定义画面距离。</p></header><div class="ip17-focal-list"><span>.5×<small>13 mm</small></span><span>1×<small>24 mm</small></span><span>2×<small>48 mm</small></span><span>4×<small>100 mm</small></span><span class="active">8×<small>200 mm</small></span></div><div class="ip17-model-shot calm"><div class="ip17-model-figure"><i></i><b></b></div><div class="ip17-camera-ui"><span>PORTRAIT</span><b>8×</b></div><p>200 mm 长焦<br><small>压缩空间，让人物与光影更有张力</small></p></div><div class="ip17-camera-cards"><article><b>48MP</b><span>主摄<br>24 / 48 mm</span></article><article><b>48MP</b><span>超广角<br>13 mm / 微距</span></article><article><b>48MP</b><span>长焦<br>100 / 200 mm</span></article></div></section>
  <section class="ip17-life-section"><div class="ip17-model-shot energy"><div class="ip17-runner"><i></i><b></b><em></em></div><div class="ip17-motion-lines"></div><p>4K 120 fps 杜比视界<br><small>从日常记录，到专业创作。</small></p></div><div class="ip17-life-copy"><p class="ip17-eyebrow">专业视频</p><h2>动起来，<br>依然稳得漂亮。</h2><p class="ip17-copy">更强的视频防抖与电影级规格，让高速运动、低光场景和专业工作流都能保持清晰、自然、有层次。</p></div></section>
  <section class="ip17-performance-section" id="performance"><div class="ip17-chip"><span>A19</span><b>PRO</b><i></i></div><div><p class="ip17-eyebrow">A19 Pro 与均热板</p><h2>持续强劲，<br>不止一瞬间。</h2><p class="ip17-copy">激光焊接均热板与铝金属一体成型结构协同导热，让高负载游戏、影像处理与本地 AI 任务保持稳定输出。</p><div class="ip17-performance-specs"><span><b>6 核</b>CPU</span><span><b>6 核</b>GPU</span><span><b>40%</b>持续性能提升</span></div></div></section>
  <section class="ip17-battery-section" id="battery"><div class="ip17-battery-copy"><p class="ip17-eyebrow">历代最长 iPhone 续航</p><h2>一天很长，<br>电量更长。</h2><p class="ip17-copy">更高效的内部布局释放更多电池空间。从通勤、创作到深夜娱乐，iPhone 17 Pro 都准备好继续。</p><div class="ip17-battery-number"><b>39</b><span>小时<br>视频播放</span></div><div class="ip17-charge"><b>20</b><span>分钟最高充至 50%</span></div></div><div class="ip17-model-shot night"><div class="ip17-night-person"><i></i><b></b></div><div class="ip17-hand-phone"><div class="ip17-screen-glow"></div></div><p>从白天，到更晚以后。</p></div></section>
  <section class="ip17-finale"><p class="ip17-eyebrow">iPhone 17 Pro</p><h2>Pro，登峰造极。</h2><div class="ip17-finale-lineup"><div class="orange"></div><div class="blue"></div><div class="silver"></div></div><p>宇宙橙 · 深蓝色 · 银色</p></section>
  <nav class="case-next ip17-next"><span>NEXT PROJECT</span><a href="<%- url_for('/projects/dewu/') %>">得物 3D 数字资产升级 →</a></nav>
</article>
<script>
(() => {
  const page = document.querySelector('.ip17-product-page');
  if (!page || matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) return;
  const items = page.querySelectorAll('h2, .ip17-copy, .ip17-product-intro .ip17-eyebrow, .ip17-unibody-visual, .ip17-stat-band > div, .ip17-camera-cards article, .ip17-performance-specs, .ip17-battery-number, .ip17-charge');
  items.forEach((item) => item.classList.add('ip17-reveal'));
  const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
    entries.forEach((entry) => {
      if (entry.isIntersecting) {
        entry.target.classList.add('is-visible');
        observer.unobserve(entry.target);
      }
    });
  }, { threshold: 0.16, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });
  items.forEach((item) => observer.observe(item));
})();
(() => {
  const hero = document.querySelector('.ip17-product-hero');
  if (!hero) return;
  const buttons = hero.querySelectorAll('[data-color-option]');
  const images = hero.querySelectorAll('[data-product-color]');
  const label = hero.querySelector('[data-color-label]');
  const names = { orange: '星宇橙', blue: '深蓝色', silver: '银色' };
  const syncProduct = () => images.forEach((image) => image.classList.toggle('is-active', image.dataset.productColor === hero.dataset.color && image.dataset.productView === hero.dataset.view));
  buttons.forEach((button) => button.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const color = button.dataset.colorOption;
    if (hero.dataset.color === color) return;
    hero.dataset.color = color;
    buttons.forEach((item) => {
      const active = item === button;
      item.classList.toggle('is-active', active);
      item.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(active));
    });
    syncProduct();
    button.classList.add('suppress-tip');
    button.addEventListener('pointerleave', () => button.classList.remove('suppress-tip'), { once: true });
  }));
  const viewButtons = hero.querySelectorAll('[data-view-option]');
  viewButtons.forEach((button) => button.addEventListener('click', () => {
    hero.dataset.view = button.dataset.viewOption;
    viewButtons.forEach((item) => {
      const active = item === button;
      item.classList.toggle('is-active', active);
      item.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(active));
    });
    syncProduct();
  }));
  const product = hero.querySelector('.ip17-hero-product');
  const sticky = hero.querySelector('.ip17-hero-sticky');
  const enterHero = () => requestAnimationFrame(() => requestAnimationFrame(() => sticky.classList.add('is-entered')));
  const openingImage = product.querySelector('img.is-active');
  if (openingImage.complete) enterHero();
  else {
    openingImage.addEventListener('load', enterHero, { once: true });
    setTimeout(enterHero, 900);
  }
  let ticking = false;
  const updateHero = () => {
    const start = matchMedia('(max-width: 600px)').matches ? 60 : 70;
    const range = Math.max(1, hero.offsetHeight - sticky.offsetHeight);
    const progress = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, (start - hero.getBoundingClientRect().top) / range));
    hero.style.setProperty('--hero-progress', progress.toFixed(3));
    const revealed = progress > 0.18;
    hero.classList.toggle('is-revealed', revealed);
    if (progress < 0.035 && (hero.dataset.color !== 'orange' || hero.dataset.view !== 'back')) {
      hero.dataset.color = 'orange';
      hero.dataset.view = 'back';
      buttons.forEach((item) => {
        const active = item.dataset.colorOption === 'orange';
        item.classList.toggle('is-active', active);
        item.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(active));
      });
      viewButtons.forEach((item) => {
        const active = item.dataset.viewOption === 'back';
        item.classList.toggle('is-active', active);
        item.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(active));
      });
      syncProduct();
    }
    ticking = false;
  };
  addEventListener('scroll', () => {
    if (!ticking) {
      requestAnimationFrame(updateHero);
      ticking = true;
    }
  }, { passive: true });
  addEventListener('resize', updateHero, { passive: true });
  updateHero();
  let dragStart = null;
  const releaseProduct = () => {
    dragStart = null;
    product.classList.remove('is-dragging');
    product.style.setProperty('--drag-x', '0px');
    product.style.setProperty('--drag-y', '0px');
  };
  product.addEventListener('pointerdown', (event) => {
    if (!hero.classList.contains('is-revealed')) return;
    dragStart = { x: event.clientX, y: event.clientY };
    product.setPointerCapture(event.pointerId);
    product.classList.add('is-dragging');
  });
  product.addEventListener('pointermove', (event) => {
    if (!dragStart) return;
    const x = event.clientX - dragStart.x;
    const y = event.clientY - dragStart.y;
    product.style.setProperty('--drag-x', x + 'px');
    product.style.setProperty('--drag-y', y + 'px');
  });
  product.addEventListener('pointerup', releaseProduct);
  product.addEventListener('pointercancel', releaseProduct);
})();
</script>
